      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so these \"ghostly\" resonances are basically just mathematical side effects of the instrument's shape? do they ever produce sounds that feel almost intentional, like they're adding a weird personality or texture to the note that doesn't seem to come from the player's breath?",
